note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note seed/ng/formal_emit/gate_formal_emit.om: Pure seeded OM-2 Verification Gate for lean_emit.om.
note Compose after seed/ng/sha256.om:
note   { printf 'om2\n'; cat seed/ng/sha256.om seed/ng/formal_emit/gate_formal_emit.om; } | seed/out/omc > gate_formal_emit
note Usage:
note   gate_formal_emit LEAN_EMIT_BIN LEAN_BIN SCRATCH_DIR [OMC_BIN REPO_ROOT]

